// ============================================================================
// MVTR-REX - GZDoom 4.14.x / DECORATE
// Mechanical Vanguard Technologies Robot
// DoomEdNum: 31000 (UDB actor number)
// Thing ID / TID is a separate map property; set it to 31000 in UDB if ACS
// scripts need to address this instance by TID.
//
// Requires the six front-facing sprite lumps:
//   MVTRA0 = Idle 1       MVTRB0 = Idle 2
//   MVTRC0 = Cannon fire 1  MVTRD0 = Cannon fire 2
//   MVTRE0 = Walk stride 1  MVTRF0 = Walk stride 2
//
// Also uses Doom II stock sprites: MISL, PLSS/PLSE, BOSF, TFOG, BEXP.
// No additional image or sound lumps are required.
// Boss stats: 30000 HP + 50% base damage factor.
// Slightly smaller for hangar clearance: Scale 0.93, Radius 130, Height 400.
// Health bar: compile MVTRBossHealthBar.acs to BEHAVIOR and assign Thing ID 31000 in UDB.
// Cannon origin: height 362 / lateral offset +46 (scaled down slightly).
// Shoulder origin: height 312 / lateral offset -46 (scaled down slightly).
// Note: collision diameter is 260 units; collision height is 400 units.
// UDB Thing ID 31000 is also used by the companion ACS health bar.
// ============================================================================

